<title>FINLAND: ARSENAL SETS 4.50 PCT COUPON ON FIM 500 MLN BOND.</title>
<headline>ARSENAL SETS 4.50 PCT COUPON ON FIM 500 MLN BOND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned asset management company Omaisuudenhoitoyhtio Arsenal Oy said in a statement on Friday the coupon on its three-year 500 million markka bond to institutional investors would be 4.50 percent.</p>
<p>The bond will be repaid in full on October 16, 1999. Annual interest will be paid on October 16.</p>
<p>Osuuspankkien Keskuspankki Oy (OKOBANK) is lead manager for the bond, Arsenal said.</p>
<p>The issue price will be floating. The date of subscription is October 11.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
